# ==========================================
# GOKART ROOT ENVIRONMENT REFERENCE
# ==========================================
# GoKart is structured into two packages:
#   1. server/  (Node.js + Express backend)
#   2. client/  (React + Vite frontend)
#
# Environment files are placed directly in each package:
#   - server/.env
#   - client/.env
#
# Dummy Database & Dummy Cloudinary are pre-configured:
#   - Dummy MongoDB URL: mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/gokart_dummy
#   - Dummy Cloudinary URI: local://dummy-media-database
#   - Dummy Admin: admin@gokart.com / Admin@123
#   - Dummy User:  user@gokart.com  / User@123
# ==========================================

